@deftypefn {} {@var{y} =} round (@var{x})
Return the integer nearest to @var{x}.

If @var{x} is complex, return
@code{round (real (@var{x})) + round (imag (@var{x})) * I}.  If there
are two nearest integers, return the one further away from zero.

@example
@group
